WEBVTT

00:07:26.999 --> 00:07:35.918
-digan kosmik parvozni 
yo'lga qo'yish tarafdoriman.

00:07:35.918 --> 00:07:40.019
Butun umrim davomida koinotni tushunishga

00:07:40.019 --> 00:07:43.536
va bu savollarga javob topishga intildim.

00:07:43.536 --> 00:07:45.376
Nogironligim bunga jiddiy to'siq

00:07:45.376 --> 00:07:49.470
bo'lmagani mening omadim.

00:07:49.470 --> 00:07:54.054
Aslida shu holatimda 
ilm bilan shug'illanish uchun

00:07:54.054 --> 00:08:00.050
boshqalarga qaraganda 
ko'proq vaqt topdim.